The instruction points at a table with several deadlines, one per reason. Each is a limit on the first reply, and "not a shorter one" suggests the deadline given is the one to use, so it works as an upper bound on the time to reply. I take each as "at most" with the role constraint.

The table lists four deadlines: same working day, five working days, two hours and three working days. "Same working day" has no number, since it is a deadline that stands for a day, which could be read as 1 working day. It is not a stated number, so I'll leave it out and give the other three.

